module test.claim.fleet.srv1_root_mutation_approval_witness
// SPLIT 2026-11-05 (gunbc#15901): this file also carried the six claims that read the EMITTED jobs, and
// with them the import of gunbc.fleet.fleet_converge_workflow -- a 7.8k-line projecting module whose
// typecheck alone outran the witness harness's 90-minute budget, so not ONE claim in this file ever
// reached a verdict. The emitted-job claims now live in test.claim.fleet
// .srv1_root_mutation_workflow_witness, the only witness that pays for the projection. What stays here is
// the part that is cheap and load-bearing: the gate fold, the request, the inheritance, the window row and
// the timing -- all read from the run module, at one interface each (DESIGN 3).

